---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import story from '../../../../../kb/research/culture/pala-website.json';
---
<Shell title={story.title} description={story.lead} active="explore" wide related={false}>
<article class="wrap pala-story"><a class="text-link collection-return" href="/sounds-of-odisha/#pala">← Sounds of Odisha</a>
<header class="pala-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Sounds of Odisha · Pala</p><h1>Poetry with<br/><em>people around it.</em></h1><p class="lead">{story.lead}</p></div><figure><img src="/images/sounds/pala-nalconagar.webp" width="1600" height="1200" alt={story.photo.alt} fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>{story.photo.caption}</figcaption></figure></header>
<div class="pala-reading">{story.blocks.map(b=><section>{b.title&&<h2>{b.title}</h2>}{b.items.length>0&&<ul>{b.items.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ul>}{b.paragraphs.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}</section>)}
<p class="notice">A sourced reader story. Practitioner/Odia review remains open; no audio recording or current performance booking is provided.</p>
<p><a href="/literature/">Explore Odia literature →</a> · <a href="/sounds-of-odisha/#daskathia">Meet Daskathia →</a></p>
<details class="utk-disclosure pala-credits"><summary>Sources, photograph &amp; reading notes</summary><p>{story.limits} Desk review: {story.reviewed_on}.</p><ul>{story.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.resource}>{s.title}</a></li>)}</ul><p>The Behera citation uses saved full-text evidence from 1 October; the recent re-fetch timed out. Kalahandi’s troupe description is local. The Sammilan report is dated 28 December 2025. Origin research is still unresolved.</p><h3>Photograph</h3><p><a href={story.photo.url}>{story.photo.creator} · Nalconagar, 2013</a> · <a href={story.photo.license_url}>{story.photo.license}</a>. {story.photo.changes} The performer is not identified here.</p></details>
<p><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fsounds-of-odisha%2Fpala%2F">Suggest a correction or a public source</a>. GitHub submissions are public; omit private contact details and consent documents.</p><a class="text-link" href="/sounds-of-odisha/">Continue the listening journey →</a></div>
</article></Shell>
<style>.pala-story{padding-bottom:70px}.collection-return{display:inline-block;margin:28px 0}.pala-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,100px);align-items:center;margin:12px 0 52px}.pala-hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,84px);line-height:1.08}.pala-hero h1 em{color:var(--sea)}.pala-hero figure{margin:0}.pala-hero img{width:100%;height:auto}.pala-hero figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.pala-reading{max-width:900px;margin:auto;font-size:19px;line-height:1.85}.pala-reading section{margin-bottom:40px}.pala-reading h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,44px);line-height:1.2;margin:36px 0 18px}.pala-reading li{margin:12px 0}.pala-credits{font-size:16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:30px 0}.pala-credits li{margin:10px 0}@media(max-width:760px){.pala-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.pala-hero h1{font-size:46px}.pala-reading{font-size:17px}.pala-reading section{margin-bottom:28px}}</style>
